WEBVTT

01:40.150 --> 01:43.060
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.160 --> 01:45.960
[Episode 4]

02:18.150 --> 02:21.930
[Big]

02:22.079 --> 02:25.730
[Sun]

02:32.960 --> 02:39.600
♫Laugh at the chaotic world's illusion, like flowers in the mirror and moonlight on water♫

02:39.640 --> 02:46.070
♫Warm the scars along the way with the sunset♫

02:47.430 --> 02:49.220
Zhao Yuanzhou...

02:52.130 --> 02:56.660
Do you still remember your old friend?

03:19.030 --> 03:19.850
Zhu...

03:20.120 --> 03:21.280
Zhu Yan?

03:26.600 --> 03:27.900
That's right.

03:28.150 --> 03:29.780
Are you scared?

03:30.280 --> 03:32.400
This is Zhu Yan's form

03:32.520 --> 03:35.420
after thousands of years of cultivation.

03:39.350 --> 03:41.970
But this is not his true form.

03:43.600 --> 03:45.210
His true form...

03:47.390 --> 03:49.520
Do you want to see it?

03:57.140 --> 04:01.940
[Second day since the Military Order]

04:04.110 --> 04:05.140
You can't escape.

04:12.090 --> 04:13.630
I may just be a kid,

04:13.680 --> 04:14.880
but I'm very capable.

04:15.500 --> 04:16.459
Why are you laughing?

04:16.459 --> 04:18.670
I'm not laughing because you're a kid.

04:18.899 --> 04:21.500
I'm laughing because I didn't plan to run away.

04:23.670 --> 04:24.430
Brother Zhuo!

04:24.430 --> 04:25.420
Sister Pei!

04:26.720 --> 04:28.110
You can't escape now.

04:28.130 --> 04:30.340
My great Mr. Zhuo is here.

04:30.680 --> 04:33.370
My plan was to lure you here.

04:45.310 --> 04:45.950
Bai Jiu!

04:45.970 --> 04:46.740
Come here!

04:46.990 --> 04:48.460
Brother Zhuo!

05:08.400 --> 05:09.290
Brother Zhuo.

05:09.670 --> 05:10.350
Who are they?

05:10.350 --> 05:11.810
Why are they arresting us?

05:12.030 --> 05:13.760
They're from the Chongwu Camp.

05:14.040 --> 05:15.530
Where are Wen Xiao and Zhao Yuanzhou?

05:15.530 --> 05:18.330
They ran after someone else from the Chongwu Camp.

05:19.160 --> 05:19.970
Bai Jiu.

05:19.990 --> 05:21.310
Hide behind us.

05:21.360 --> 05:22.720
Be careful.

05:32.570 --> 05:37.750
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

05:37.790 --> 05:40.900
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

05:40.980 --> 05:43.990
♫The world and universe sing for me♫

05:44.060 --> 05:45.530
♫Spring, summer, autumn, winter; everything becomes nothing♫

05:45.550 --> 05:50.460
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

05:50.460 --> 05:53.760
♫My definitions for right and wrong differ♫

05:53.790 --> 05:56.870
♫Bury your pride in the raging river♫

05:56.909 --> 06:00.320
♫Lamenting that all beings are powerless♫

06:11.600 --> 06:12.430
Brother Zhuo!

07:11.860 --> 07:13.490
What do you want?

07:15.610 --> 07:18.670
I just want to catch up with my old friend.

07:20.700 --> 07:22.030
What's wrong with that?

07:28.790 --> 07:29.590
It's a trap.

07:33.590 --> 07:35.130
He's stalling us.

07:35.600 --> 07:37.230
He lured us away...

07:39.280 --> 07:41.140
Zhuo and the others are in danger.

07:46.740 --> 07:49.040
You have two options.

07:49.780 --> 07:51.820
Change your form and fly off

07:51.850 --> 07:53.640
to save your friends,

07:55.200 --> 07:56.510
leaving her

07:56.830 --> 07:57.870
to me.

08:01.040 --> 08:03.720
Or, you can protect her here

08:05.670 --> 08:07.530
and let your friends

08:07.620 --> 08:09.460
fend for themselves.

08:10.100 --> 08:12.030
Go and save Zhuo and the others.

08:12.600 --> 08:14.160
We have a blood oath.

08:15.070 --> 08:16.580
I must protect you.

08:16.710 --> 08:18.260
What about Zhuo?

08:19.110 --> 08:21.570
Zhuo is facing people from the Chongwu Camp.

08:22.190 --> 08:23.650
There are no demons there.

08:23.920 --> 08:25.180
They don't know magic.

08:26.110 --> 08:27.670
Zhuo has no trouble

08:29.030 --> 08:30.270
dealing with them.

08:49.140 --> 08:50.920
You are not from Chongwu Camp.

08:53.040 --> 08:55.770
People from Chongwu Camp don't have such skills.

09:37.790 --> 09:38.470
I got it!

09:38.590 --> 09:39.400
I got it!

09:51.560 --> 09:52.470
Sister Pei.

09:53.000 --> 09:54.420
This is it.

09:56.030 --> 09:56.830
Brother Zhuo.

09:56.830 --> 09:58.760
This was the source of the trouble.

09:59.840 --> 10:02.500
This is a talisman drawn with Xing Tian's blood.

10:02.590 --> 10:03.680
Xing Tian?

10:05.890 --> 10:07.150
Only his body remains,

10:07.200 --> 10:08.550
yet he fights on without a head.

10:08.550 --> 10:09.780
His name is Xing Tian.

10:10.800 --> 10:11.560
Bai Jiu.

10:11.750 --> 10:13.650
Ms. Pei and I will handle them.

10:13.670 --> 10:15.600
You need to destroy all the talismans.

10:15.600 --> 10:16.190
Yes, sir.

11:48.000 --> 11:48.600
But...

11:49.400 --> 11:51.660
Why did Chongwu Camp's people ambush us?

11:51.840 --> 11:53.280
From the beginning,

11:54.080 --> 11:55.760
this was a trap.

11:56.970 --> 11:58.750
As long as you lure the Demon Hunting Bureau's people

11:58.750 --> 12:00.120
to the demon hunters,

12:00.230 --> 12:03.390
I have my way of keeping them there.

12:04.520 --> 12:06.130
You appeared on purpose

12:07.230 --> 12:09.250
just to lure me away.

12:09.610 --> 12:11.280
Stupid Chongwu Camp.

12:12.060 --> 12:14.230
They don't deserve to fight you.

12:15.750 --> 12:18.040
Need I find the right match for a fight too?

12:18.040 --> 12:20.120
Everything in the world

12:20.600 --> 12:22.590
deserves the right match.

12:26.910 --> 12:28.920
She is a goddess without divine power.

12:28.920 --> 12:31.430
She doesn't deserve to stand

12:31.640 --> 12:33.020
by your side.

12:36.220 --> 12:38.360
We're here to catch up as old friends.

12:39.740 --> 12:42.910
As for this joke of a goddess,

12:43.610 --> 12:45.710
let me kill her for you.

12:45.950 --> 12:48.120
You can try.

12:51.240 --> 12:53.640
How long can you protect her?

12:54.510 --> 12:56.610
For this moment,

12:57.330 --> 13:00.010
or forever?

13:08.610 --> 13:10.210
You don't have to protect me.

13:16.700 --> 13:19.180
The blood feud between me and Li Lun

13:19.880 --> 13:21.650
shall end here.

13:24.550 --> 13:25.000
Oh?

13:29.240 --> 13:31.630
You have no divine power now.

13:32.070 --> 13:34.520
All you have is the form of a weak mortal.

13:35.790 --> 13:36.790
End, you say?

13:39.820 --> 13:41.690
Do you mean ending your own life?

14:02.350 --> 14:03.760
A mortal's body

14:04.210 --> 14:07.120
can't bear the Truth Eye for a long time.

14:08.500 --> 14:12.160
Aren't you just afraid she'll see your true form?

14:46.940 --> 14:48.300
This trick again?

14:48.590 --> 14:50.020
Didn't you say you wanted to

14:50.020 --> 14:51.580
end the blood feud today?

14:51.610 --> 14:53.680
A gentleman's revenge is never too late.

14:53.680 --> 14:55.420
A lady's revenge must be flexible.

14:55.420 --> 14:55.980
What?

15:06.870 --> 15:08.000
Are you okay?

15:11.790 --> 15:12.600
Let me do it.

15:12.680 --> 15:13.410
I'm a doctor.

15:35.800 --> 15:37.260
Why are you crying?

15:39.200 --> 15:41.660
You and Sister Pei are both good at fighting.

15:42.540 --> 15:44.120
If it weren't for me,

15:45.220 --> 15:46.950
you wouldn't have gotten hurt.

15:47.180 --> 15:48.660
I dragged you down.

15:54.240 --> 15:54.990
But

15:54.990 --> 15:56.120
those talismans

15:56.560 --> 15:57.800
were found

16:00.190 --> 16:02.040
and destroyed by you.

16:06.040 --> 16:06.840
Jiu.

16:08.390 --> 16:09.490
Without you,

16:10.430 --> 16:11.750
we might have gotten

16:11.750 --> 16:13.920
more than just a few injuries.

16:18.390 --> 16:19.620
Really,

16:20.150 --> 16:21.110
Mr. Zhuo?

16:24.590 --> 16:26.240
Sorry for the trouble, but...

16:26.240 --> 16:27.310
Oh, it's no trouble at all.

16:27.310 --> 16:28.910
Can you work a little faster?

16:28.970 --> 16:30.590
My wound is still bleeding.

16:30.760 --> 16:31.400
Oh.

16:34.840 --> 16:37.160
The blood of the Bingyi Clan is useful,

16:37.390 --> 16:39.720
but it's very draining for you to use it.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.960
Try to use less in the future.

16:42.170 --> 16:43.670
I'll get you some ginger date cakes

16:43.670 --> 16:44.460
to replenish your blood.

16:44.460 --> 16:46.190
Let me see if I have more inside.

16:49.880 --> 16:50.830
Enough.

16:52.400 --> 16:53.120
Oh.

16:54.920 --> 16:55.640
Oh...

17:09.920 --> 17:10.760
Thank you.

17:22.300 --> 17:23.740
Are you talking to me?

17:24.609 --> 17:25.750
This time,

17:26.079 --> 17:27.339
it's all thanks to you.

17:29.890 --> 17:31.040
From now on,

17:31.960 --> 17:33.830
I won't look down on you anymore.

17:36.750 --> 17:37.810
I promise that

17:38.080 --> 17:39.380
as long as I'm here,

17:39.400 --> 17:40.660
you will never die.

17:45.030 --> 17:46.490
You won't resign anymore?

17:48.410 --> 17:50.680
I'm telling Mr. Zhuo that I'm resigning.

17:56.310 --> 17:57.950
You're not the only one

17:58.110 --> 17:59.710
in the Demon Hunting Bureau.

18:00.670 --> 18:01.820
Next time,

18:02.480 --> 18:03.740
you don't have to

18:03.820 --> 18:05.350
bear everything yourself.

18:05.900 --> 18:07.140
I’m the commander.

18:07.580 --> 18:10.240
I have the responsibility to protect all of you.

18:10.560 --> 18:12.020
I'm more skilled than you.

18:12.690 --> 18:15.550
I have the responsibility to protect all of you too.

18:21.520 --> 18:22.750
Are you all right?

18:24.470 --> 18:26.470
Sister Pei and Mr. Zhuo are with me.

18:26.500 --> 18:27.700
It's alright now.

18:29.350 --> 18:30.580
I trust you.

18:31.120 --> 18:32.320
But I don't trust him.

18:40.400 --> 18:41.320
Are you okay?

18:48.390 --> 18:49.500
I don't need it.

18:55.160 --> 18:56.960
Here's some free demonic energy

18:56.960 --> 18:58.400
so that you can kill me

18:58.590 --> 18:59.790
easier in the future.

19:17.360 --> 19:18.750
Traceless repair...

19:19.390 --> 19:21.200
I think I'm going to lose my job.

19:25.980 --> 19:29.130
♫The trees and grass of the world sway with the wind♫

19:29.190 --> 19:32.470
♫Beneath the bodhi tree, dust gathers♫

19:34.510 --> 19:37.520
♫Who truly decides fate's design?♫

19:37.560 --> 19:40.980
♫Vividly painted in black and white♫

19:44.320 --> 19:45.280
Sir.

19:46.560 --> 19:47.350
It failed.

19:47.960 --> 19:49.090
You bunch of losers!

19:49.220 --> 19:51.880
You can't even handle the Demon Hunting Bureau?

20:03.490 --> 20:04.470
Who are you?

20:05.310 --> 20:07.980
I'm the only person who can kill him.

20:10.070 --> 20:11.500
Look at me.

20:31.420 --> 20:33.550
I want an answer.

20:35.160 --> 20:36.890
I have three questions for you.

20:37.510 --> 20:38.840
Get them right,

20:39.700 --> 20:40.480
and you live.

20:42.160 --> 20:43.400
Get them wrong,

20:44.640 --> 20:45.680
and you die.

20:50.050 --> 20:51.510
First question.

20:52.640 --> 20:54.640
Do you think it's better to be a human

20:55.480 --> 20:57.520
or a demon?

20:59.360 --> 21:00.760
It's better to be a demon.

21:00.990 --> 21:01.800
A demon.

21:06.640 --> 21:08.190
Wrong answer.

21:13.570 --> 21:15.470
Why didn't you tell me

21:15.730 --> 21:17.570
before killing one of my men?

21:18.430 --> 21:21.360
You didn't tell me before

21:22.240 --> 21:24.250
you hurt Zhao Yuanzhou either.

21:25.940 --> 21:29.670
King Xiang sent him here to spy on Chongwu Camp.

21:29.880 --> 21:31.940
I thought he was a hindrance long ago.

21:32.250 --> 21:33.640
Thanks for killing him

21:33.660 --> 21:34.840
for me.

21:35.480 --> 21:36.640
I'm glad you know.

21:37.480 --> 21:38.640
Don't forget

21:39.440 --> 21:41.340
our promise.

21:41.570 --> 21:43.710
I will help you find the Baize Token.

22:12.040 --> 22:13.010
My Lady.

22:15.160 --> 22:16.280
My Lady?

22:22.190 --> 22:26.710
[Third day since the Military Order]

22:28.570 --> 22:29.210
Oh my god!

22:29.240 --> 22:30.610
This is terrible.

22:30.840 --> 22:32.310
This won't do.

22:32.320 --> 22:34.560
This won't do.

22:35.540 --> 22:37.000
Why are you in such a hurry?

22:37.130 --> 22:38.260
Did you step on poop?

22:39.190 --> 22:39.920
It's all my fault.

22:39.920 --> 22:40.800
I'm too short

22:40.800 --> 22:41.830
and too weak.

22:42.000 --> 22:43.200
My medicine box is too small

22:43.200 --> 22:44.680
to hold enough herbs and pills.

22:44.680 --> 22:46.960
I only managed to slightly replenish Mr. Zhuo's blood.

22:46.960 --> 22:47.830
But I didn't have the

22:47.830 --> 22:48.680
multi-nutrition pill,

22:48.680 --> 22:49.560
tortoise and deer treatment gum,

22:49.560 --> 22:50.520
ancient wood liver-boosting powder,

22:50.520 --> 22:52.690
heavenly king heart-boosting pill...

22:52.690 --> 22:53.360
Mr. Zhuo

22:53.360 --> 22:55.180
just cut his hand.

22:55.440 --> 22:57.040
He wasn't hit by a carriage.

22:57.440 --> 22:58.440
Oh, please.

22:58.770 --> 22:59.580
You don't understand.

22:59.580 --> 23:00.280
Do you think everyone

23:00.280 --> 23:01.400
is like you, a great demon?

23:01.400 --> 23:02.680
You have thick skin.

23:02.680 --> 23:03.640
You can heal wounds

23:03.640 --> 23:04.760
with a small spell.

23:04.840 --> 23:05.960
Before you arrived,

23:05.960 --> 23:08.140
Mr. Zhuo protected me and Sister Pei.

23:08.160 --> 23:08.620
Well...

23:08.630 --> 23:09.200
Well, he...

23:09.200 --> 23:11.270
He was beaten up by that bad guy.

23:11.480 --> 23:12.650
So he's quite weak.

23:18.160 --> 23:19.520
Are you blind?

23:19.520 --> 23:21.620
I'll bring you some medicine for your eyes next time.

23:21.620 --> 23:23.130
You should take some medicine

23:23.130 --> 23:24.500
and treat your eyes.

23:24.640 --> 23:25.760
I am a great demon

23:25.760 --> 23:27.190
with amazing power.

23:27.240 --> 23:28.800
But you're ignoring me and

23:28.800 --> 23:30.480
only care about your Mr. Zhuo.

23:31.040 --> 23:32.140
Kid.

23:32.730 --> 23:33.920
If you broaden your horizons,

23:33.920 --> 23:34.960
you'll find

23:35.260 --> 23:36.760
someone better and stronger

23:36.760 --> 23:38.600
to be your role model.

23:39.200 --> 23:39.900
For example...

23:39.900 --> 23:40.720
Sister Pei.

23:47.060 --> 23:48.070
She's weaker.

23:53.990 --> 23:55.200
Quit wasting my time.

23:55.200 --> 23:56.860
I need to replenish the herbs.

23:57.020 --> 23:57.780
What are you doing?

23:57.780 --> 23:59.860
Don't you think I'm weak?

24:00.080 --> 24:02.000
I can use my power to

24:02.000 --> 24:03.930
make your medicine box really big.

24:04.030 --> 24:05.880
Then you can put all the medicine

24:05.880 --> 24:07.290
inside in the future.

24:07.490 --> 24:09.420
You'll never have to worry about not being able

24:09.420 --> 24:10.820
to save him in the future.

24:11.300 --> 24:12.690
You're just bragging.

24:24.120 --> 24:25.070
So big?

24:28.500 --> 24:29.650
Oh my god.

24:38.820 --> 24:40.400
Amazing.

24:42.060 --> 24:43.670
How do I pack it in again?

24:43.700 --> 24:45.220
It can't be this big forever, right?

24:45.220 --> 24:47.050
See that bell up there?

24:47.410 --> 24:48.300
Ring it.

24:50.390 --> 24:51.260
Fold.

24:59.780 --> 25:00.680
How is it?

25:00.770 --> 25:02.710
Am I better than Mr. Zhuo now?

25:03.960 --> 25:04.850
Mm...

25:05.880 --> 25:06.940
I have to admit that

25:07.240 --> 25:08.840
you're almost as good as him.

25:24.470 --> 25:25.280
Zhuo.

25:25.920 --> 25:27.160
Listen to me.

25:27.180 --> 25:27.720
Don't...

25:27.720 --> 25:29.980
Don't show off if you're not good enough.

25:35.130 --> 25:36.470
Ignore him.

25:36.500 --> 25:38.120
What I want to say is,

25:38.620 --> 25:41.210
don't ignore the right actions at the right time.

25:41.210 --> 25:42.880
If you can't beat them, outrun them.

25:42.880 --> 25:44.810
No need to force yourself to fight.

25:47.940 --> 25:50.460
Ms. Wen Xiao and I share the same view.

25:55.700 --> 25:56.790
Zhu Yan.

25:56.970 --> 25:58.570
What a good name.

25:59.110 --> 26:00.260
Let me guess.

26:01.030 --> 26:03.290
The "Yan" stands for "annoying", right?

26:06.140 --> 26:07.510
Mr. Zhuo.

26:07.530 --> 26:08.670
Your Bingyi Clan

26:08.910 --> 26:11.770
has a secret technique to coagulate water into ice.

26:11.890 --> 26:14.440
It's better than drawing your blood in battle.

26:14.440 --> 26:15.970
I don't know how to use that.

26:17.180 --> 26:19.030
You don't know?

26:20.570 --> 26:22.040
Do you?

26:22.070 --> 26:22.880
Of course.

26:24.440 --> 26:26.640
It's written in so many books.

26:26.850 --> 26:28.190
"The great demon Zhu Yan

26:28.560 --> 26:30.260
is skilled in thousands of divine magic

26:30.260 --> 26:32.060
and all kinds of demonic magic."

26:32.680 --> 26:35.500
Ms. Wen Xiao, your name is also nice.

26:35.710 --> 26:36.950
Let me guess.

26:36.980 --> 26:38.980
Does "Wen" stand for "illiterate?"

26:46.020 --> 26:47.300
Mr. Zhuo.

26:48.010 --> 26:49.100
I can teach you.

26:49.170 --> 26:50.230
It's not hard.

26:50.590 --> 26:52.100
If there is water,

26:52.140 --> 26:54.130
you can use your senses

26:54.170 --> 26:55.750
to control them.

26:56.840 --> 26:57.760
Teach me if you want.

26:57.760 --> 26:58.640
Cut the crap.

27:00.240 --> 27:01.250
Come closer then.

27:02.850 --> 27:03.690
Why?

27:04.250 --> 27:05.520
The Bingyi secret technique

27:05.520 --> 27:07.250
cannot be heard by outsiders.

27:07.900 --> 27:08.570
Oh.

27:09.710 --> 27:10.770
Outsider, you say?

27:13.390 --> 27:14.880
Then I, the outsider,

27:14.880 --> 27:15.990
shall take my leave.

27:15.990 --> 27:16.870
No need.

27:18.000 --> 27:20.920
This is a secret technique only descendants of the Bingyi Clan can use.

27:20.920 --> 27:22.890
Even if you learn about it, it's useless.

27:22.890 --> 27:24.450
Then why did you say that?

27:24.470 --> 27:25.800
You're playing tricks.

27:26.020 --> 27:27.280
Hurry up and come here.

27:27.810 --> 27:28.610
Okay.

27:37.400 --> 27:38.590
Miss Outsider,

27:39.840 --> 27:40.920
please make way.

27:41.120 --> 27:41.930
Okay.

28:02.060 --> 28:04.060
The strength comes from the senses.

28:04.550 --> 28:06.280
The form comes from the spirit.

28:06.760 --> 28:08.200
Channel your energy along

28:08.200 --> 28:10.760
the path that I've drawn out for you.

28:21.630 --> 28:23.680
The mind is endless,

28:23.710 --> 28:25.440
the flowing water is tireless.

28:35.240 --> 28:36.890
Aren't you ungrateful?

28:39.240 --> 28:40.480
The tea is so cold.

28:41.080 --> 28:42.690
It's as cold as my heart.

28:43.300 --> 28:44.640
Isn't that nice?

28:44.850 --> 28:45.940
Drink some herbal tea

28:45.940 --> 28:47.150
and calm down.

28:49.790 --> 28:51.830
Mr. Zhuo, you learn fast.

28:52.850 --> 28:54.710
But it'll take a lot of practicing

28:55.420 --> 28:57.290
for you to be able to hit me.

29:00.290 --> 29:01.720
Mr. Zhuo.

29:02.090 --> 29:03.750
Take care of yourself.

29:11.570 --> 29:13.230
Are you really hurt?

29:13.470 --> 29:14.280
Get up.

29:14.280 --> 29:15.420
Don't make trouble.

29:15.900 --> 29:17.830
I'll stay here to take care of Zhuo.

29:17.840 --> 29:18.920
Go back first.

29:18.940 --> 29:21.080
Don't delay Mr. Zhuo's recovery.

29:21.370 --> 29:22.580
No way.

29:22.820 --> 29:24.480
I have to stay and protect you.

29:24.780 --> 29:26.560
If Li Lun comes,

29:26.590 --> 29:28.590
Mr. Zhuo can't deal with him.

29:29.600 --> 29:30.760
Li Lun?

29:34.550 --> 29:35.560
Who is Li Lun?

29:47.140 --> 29:48.730
According to you,

29:49.260 --> 29:51.310
Li Lun is here for you.

29:51.900 --> 29:53.540
Are you familiar with Li Lun?

29:54.210 --> 29:55.020
Yes.

29:55.800 --> 29:58.130
We have known each other since childhood.

29:58.600 --> 30:00.100
What kind of demon is he?

30:00.270 --> 30:02.670
Why can he possess others?

30:03.250 --> 30:04.450
Li Lun is a tree demon.

30:04.980 --> 30:08.050
His true form is an ancient pagoda tree that likes Yin energy.

30:08.050 --> 30:10.850
His spirit can be held in a single pagoda tree leaf.

30:10.900 --> 30:12.360
Once the leaf lands on the body,

30:12.360 --> 30:13.740
his spirit will possess it,

30:13.740 --> 30:15.860
thereby parasitizing other living beings

30:15.860 --> 30:17.730
and controlling their behaviors.

30:17.730 --> 30:18.930
Is he looking for you?

30:20.160 --> 30:20.760
Yes.

30:21.930 --> 30:23.130
You're avoiding him?

30:24.480 --> 30:26.340
He did many evil things back then.

30:26.560 --> 30:27.880
To uphold justice and punish the evil,

30:27.880 --> 30:29.080
I taught him a lesson.

30:29.190 --> 30:30.630
He's very petty about it

30:30.700 --> 30:32.430
and wants to kill me as revenge.

30:32.680 --> 30:33.810
That's why

30:33.930 --> 30:36.300
I chose to cooperate with the Demon Hunting Bureau

30:36.300 --> 30:38.370
and asked you to deal with him for me.

30:38.710 --> 30:41.590
But I didn't expect you guys to be so weak.

30:49.290 --> 30:51.620
Do you know that there is a formation here?

30:54.820 --> 30:57.510
If someone lies here,

30:57.920 --> 30:59.720
they'll grow a fox tail.

31:06.840 --> 31:07.600
I'm tired.

31:09.070 --> 31:09.870
Commander Zhuo.

31:09.870 --> 31:11.090
Something big happened in Tiandu.

31:11.090 --> 31:12.840
General Wu Yan of Chongwu Camp

31:13.120 --> 31:13.960
was killed.

31:14.090 --> 31:14.890
What?

31:21.680 --> 31:23.470
Zhuo, get some rest.

31:23.730 --> 31:24.870
Don't worry.

31:26.820 --> 31:27.840
Zhao Yuanzhou.

31:28.040 --> 31:28.840
Come with me.

31:31.960 --> 31:32.870
Wen Xiao.

32:04.400 --> 32:05.290
Sir.

32:05.320 --> 32:06.710
Wu Yan is dead.

32:07.100 --> 32:09.270
Will King Xiang hold us accountable?

32:09.700 --> 32:11.970
General was not killed by a demon

32:12.080 --> 32:14.040
but by the Demon Hunting Bureau's members.

32:14.040 --> 32:14.840
Understand?

32:15.080 --> 32:15.770
Yes.

32:17.420 --> 32:19.560
Wu Yan was killed by a demon.

32:19.770 --> 32:21.700
Why are they blaming the Demon Hunting Bureau now?

32:21.700 --> 32:22.610
Chongwu Camp

32:22.640 --> 32:24.220
exaggerated and twisted the truth,

32:24.220 --> 32:26.530
slandering us before King Xiang.

32:26.560 --> 32:28.700
Fortunately, the Prime Minister pleaded

32:28.700 --> 32:30.110
for us and got us

32:30.130 --> 32:31.490
one last day of pardon

32:32.520 --> 32:33.880
One last day?

32:33.910 --> 32:36.240
So our five days of pardon became one?

32:36.530 --> 32:38.190
Tomorrow's our death day?

32:38.220 --> 32:39.890
King Xiang ordered for the five of you

32:39.890 --> 32:41.480
to catch the Water Ghost

32:41.500 --> 32:42.760
before noon tomorrow.

32:43.190 --> 32:44.520
Otherwise,

32:44.560 --> 32:46.680
the entire Demon Hunting Bureau

32:47.000 --> 32:48.810
will be punished together.

32:53.650 --> 32:55.490
There's only one day left.

32:58.240 --> 33:00.400
Then we can't wait until the Water Ghost's marriage

33:00.400 --> 33:02.080
for Ran Yi to show up.

33:02.110 --> 33:03.750
We must take the initiative.

33:03.810 --> 33:05.220
We'll catch him today.

33:05.410 --> 33:06.690
How?

33:06.930 --> 33:08.550
The clues are all gone.

33:08.680 --> 33:09.480
No.

33:11.200 --> 33:12.600
There's one last person.

33:12.860 --> 33:15.110
A person who has been hiding in the dark

33:16.150 --> 33:17.950
but remains crucial to the case.

33:19.700 --> 33:20.870
Miss Qi.

33:21.840 --> 33:23.280
The Water Ghost Marriage Case

33:23.280 --> 33:25.200
involves dozens of victims.

33:25.610 --> 33:27.640
But besides Miss Qi,

33:27.800 --> 33:28.840
other brides

33:28.860 --> 33:31.120
didn't receive Ran Yi's wedding letter.

33:31.550 --> 33:33.340
I believe she must be

33:34.000 --> 33:35.410
hiding a big secret.

33:39.480 --> 33:40.880
Miss Qi has gone missing.

33:43.470 --> 33:44.660
My Lady?

33:48.620 --> 33:49.930
What should we do now?

33:50.200 --> 33:51.860
The only clue is gone.

33:55.490 --> 33:57.220
There's another clue.

34:00.800 --> 34:01.930
Master Qi.

34:03.620 --> 34:04.280
Master Qi

34:04.280 --> 34:07.410
purposely leaked the information about the demon hunter to us

34:07.410 --> 34:09.650
and asked Commander Zhuo and me to investigate.

34:09.650 --> 34:11.050
We were then ambushed.

34:11.100 --> 34:12.550
He is indeed suspicious.

34:13.219 --> 34:15.090
Go to Qi's Mansion

34:15.280 --> 34:17.219
and investigate Master Qi.

34:17.239 --> 34:19.460
I'll use my demon power to track Miss Qi.

34:19.989 --> 34:21.570
Maybe I can find her.

34:22.960 --> 34:23.520
Okay.

34:23.760 --> 34:25.199
Let's split up.

35:00.570 --> 35:01.880
Why are you here alone?

35:03.130 --> 35:03.930
Where is she?

35:04.370 --> 35:05.970
Miss Qi is missing.

35:07.600 --> 35:08.730
Isn't she here?

35:10.480 --> 35:11.770
She's missing?

35:26.020 --> 35:27.640
When I came here last time,

35:27.980 --> 35:30.360
this island wasn't in the middle of the lake.

35:30.360 --> 35:32.850
It must have been hidden by a barrier.

35:34.050 --> 35:36.350
But even a great demon like Zhao Yuanzhou

35:37.150 --> 35:38.760
didn't notice it.

35:39.920 --> 35:42.300
Because he colluded with Ran Yi long ago.

35:43.710 --> 35:44.940
Mr. Zhuo.

35:45.510 --> 35:47.310
Take care.

35:59.880 --> 36:02.540
Fortunately, Ms. Pei's demonic energy-tracking skill

36:02.540 --> 36:04.000
brought us here.

36:09.430 --> 36:10.820
I'm being followed.

36:11.380 --> 36:12.400
So annoying.

36:13.820 --> 36:15.330
With Ms. Pei here,

36:15.480 --> 36:18.140
our Demon Hunting Bureau became very powerful.

36:18.140 --> 36:19.050
How nice.

36:23.390 --> 36:24.910
After this case is closed,

36:25.920 --> 36:27.980
I will quit the Demon Hunting Bureau.

36:28.160 --> 36:29.200
Why?

36:30.060 --> 36:32.740
I don't want to get involved in demons anymore.

36:32.960 --> 36:35.110
Zhao Yuanzhou used my brother as the reason

36:35.110 --> 36:36.440
and got me involved.

36:37.780 --> 36:39.840
But I never trusted him.

36:40.400 --> 36:42.160
I went to the Demon Hunting Bureau

36:42.160 --> 36:43.820
to return the token.

36:44.930 --> 36:47.740
But I signed the Military Order

36:48.160 --> 36:50.360
under the provocation of Chongwu Camp.

36:51.290 --> 36:53.200
Now he colluded with Ran Yi.

36:53.430 --> 36:54.490
We can't trust him.

36:58.190 --> 37:00.320
Zhu Yan cannot be controlled.

37:01.600 --> 37:04.200
I think you know that better than I do, Mr. Zhuo.

37:05.970 --> 37:07.850
I hope you can cut your losses

37:08.670 --> 37:10.670
and stop trusting the wrong people.

37:12.490 --> 37:14.170
Since you didn't invite them,

37:15.170 --> 37:17.330
don't blame me for being rude.

37:41.650 --> 37:42.400
Be careful!

38:07.570 --> 38:08.370
Wen Xiao?

38:10.560 --> 38:11.400
Mr. Zhuo?

38:33.880 --> 38:34.850
Wen Xiao?

38:36.640 --> 38:37.680
Mr. Zhuo?

39:02.610 --> 39:04.490
Those who are as firm as a rock

39:05.240 --> 39:07.120
will also break down in despair.

39:09.770 --> 39:12.370
Hurry up and release your dream control magic.

39:13.570 --> 39:15.630
Once the Dream Control Magic is used,

39:15.960 --> 39:17.200
no one can release it.

39:18.440 --> 39:19.920
The dreamers must

39:19.920 --> 39:22.040
realize that they are dreaming

39:22.640 --> 39:24.500
to escape the dreams themselves.

39:25.360 --> 39:26.380
Otherwise,

39:26.530 --> 39:29.190
they will be trapped in this nightmare forever.

39:31.610 --> 39:32.410
Besides,

39:33.820 --> 39:35.700
didn't you ask me to do this?

40:10.520 --> 40:11.910
Interesting.

40:12.690 --> 40:13.720
How are you resisting

40:13.720 --> 40:15.370
my dream control magic?

40:18.770 --> 40:20.100
It's him.

40:32.590 --> 40:33.880
It's really him.

41:23.730 --> 41:25.120
Go find her.
